      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'This was a group Project I worked on for Unit GAD314, with members: Jayden
    Holliss, Alex Frederick and Lathika. My role was Narrative Director, Writer,
    Documentation and programmer. My role as programmer was never intended but during
    development I felt that since I had plenty of freetime, I helped implement an
    extra puzzle element. I programmed a safe code mechanic. This had an interactable
    keypad UI and I also created a safe model in Blender with an additional animation
    of the safe door opening.'
