  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'One Particular obstacle I encountered during my progress was having to
    have my images and audio remain linked to the project. Whenever I sent my project
    publically, audio and images were never attached to the finished version. With
    lecturer assistance, we discovered that the issue was due to having the audio
    and images never linked within the actual files of the project itself. By attaching
    the audio and images within the folder like a dowloadable ''pack'' with file
    explorer, this always ensured that the audio images were never lost upon public
    access.


    (2/2)'
